WEBVTT

00:01.350 --> 00:03.312
Levi and the Scouts clashed
with Kenny's squad,

00:03.337 --> 00:06.454
charging straight
into their defense.

00:06.940 --> 00:09.900
All to reach and rescue Eren and Historia.

00:11.070 --> 00:12.070
However...

00:19.910 --> 00:21.950
Fall back to the final defensive post!

00:22.120 --> 00:23.490
Time to regroup!

00:24.500 --> 00:26.880
I'm praying, Historia.

00:27.130 --> 00:30.550
For God to lead and guide humanity!

00:32.510 --> 00:33.920
God, my ass!

00:34.010 --> 00:37.550
You're just giving yourself an out
and manipulating other people!

00:37.680 --> 00:41.130
I've had it! I won't let you kill me!

00:42.140 --> 00:43.850
That's the spirit!

00:43.930 --> 00:45.350
This is gettin' good!

00:45.810 --> 00:47.689
You escape from here.

00:47.690 --> 00:49.730
I'll destroy everything else!

00:50.610 --> 00:51.900
Father...

00:52.480 --> 00:53.570
Uri...

00:54.240 --> 00:55.240
Frieda...

00:55.860 --> 00:56.970
Wait for me...

00:57.950 --> 00:59.050
...now...

02:35.000 --> 02:40.010
"Outside the Walls of Orvud District"

02:47.930 --> 02:50.880
It's gotta be a way through
if it's all plugged up.

02:51.440 --> 02:52.440
Shit.

02:52.520 --> 02:54.720
If only we had some gunpowder left...

02:55.690 --> 02:57.440
We cannot let them through!

02:58.400 --> 03:00.390
As long as we hold here, we're good!

03:06.200 --> 03:07.060
That's...

03:07.200 --> 03:08.200
A Titan transformed?

03:08.620 --> 03:09.620
Eren!

03:22.760 --> 03:24.850
Here it comes! Hang on tight!

03:29.270 --> 03:31.400
Th-This place is gonna collapse!

03:35.650 --> 03:37.190
Captain!

03:37.360 --> 03:38.360
The hole!

03:41.780 --> 03:45.660
Armin! Moblit! Take Hange
and get the hell out of here!

03:48.740 --> 03:50.369
Rod Reiss!

03:50.370 --> 03:52.160
You bastard!

03:52.410 --> 03:54.079
Forget it, Historia!

03:54.080 --> 03:58.710
Since that Titan's from the Reiss family,
just let him come and eat me!

03:58.750 --> 04:00.379
Get out of here!

04:00.380 --> 04:01.220
Hell no!

04:01.221 --> 04:02.970
Why won't you listen?!

04:03.340 --> 04:06.720
I might be humanity's
enemy, but I'm your ally!

04:08.100 --> 04:11.519
I can't be a good girl,
and I don't wanna be God either!

04:11.520 --> 04:12.520
But...

04:12.560 --> 04:16.210
When I see people crying to themselves,
saying they're not needed...

04:16.480 --> 04:19.020
...I wanna tell those people
that's just not true!

04:19.980 --> 04:22.630
No matter who! No matter where!

04:23.530 --> 04:25.490
I'll come to their rescue!

04:30.160 --> 04:31.160
Historia!

04:33.160 --> 04:34.160
You okay?

04:34.250 --> 04:35.300
Mikasa!

04:38.710 --> 04:39.710
Give me the keys!

04:39.840 --> 04:42.050
Captain? You guys...

04:45.760 --> 04:46.860
Conny, hurry!

04:47.430 --> 04:48.759
Forget about me!

04:48.760 --> 04:50.679
Captain! Hurry and escape!

04:50.680 --> 04:53.060
Shut up already, you topless wimp!

04:53.430 --> 04:56.980
It's not just a Titan!
There're dudes with guns coming for us!

04:58.020 --> 04:59.020
He's loose!

05:00.980 --> 05:01.980
I think...

05:02.230 --> 05:04.990
That's way bigger than
the Colossal Titan, isn't it?

05:08.160 --> 05:10.240
The ceiling...? Look out!

05:11.240 --> 05:12.240
Get back!

05:19.460 --> 05:23.510
Hey, hey, Rod! Ya done goofed up big time!

05:23.840 --> 05:27.089
You thought ya knew Titans
more than the rest of us!

05:27.090 --> 05:29.680
Now I know you didn't, ya dumb shit!

05:30.300 --> 05:31.390
Captain Ackermann!

05:32.010 --> 05:33.140
Idiots! Get away!

05:37.810 --> 05:40.030
Shit! There's no way out!

05:41.940 --> 05:42.940
Why?

05:43.650 --> 05:45.860
Wasn't he going to eat me?

05:49.110 --> 05:50.510
Should I transform?

05:51.580 --> 05:55.080
No... My Titan can't withstand all this...

06:01.790 --> 06:04.030
I'm sorry, everyone...

06:08.760 --> 06:11.370
I've been nothing but useless...

06:12.140 --> 06:17.390
Ever since the very beginning,
I was never the hope of humanity...

06:22.110 --> 06:23.230
Armor?

06:24.320 --> 06:27.070
What's this? Think you're some tragic hero?

06:27.820 --> 06:32.029
When have you ever accomplished
anything by your strength alone?

06:32.030 --> 06:33.310
What a weakling.

06:33.700 --> 06:36.079
We've been through much worse than this.

06:36.080 --> 06:38.120
Not that I wanna get used to it!

06:38.910 --> 06:42.810
Still, it's going to suck trying
to navigate through all that.

06:43.710 --> 06:44.840
I'll take Eren.

06:45.750 --> 06:49.509
We can't go nice and slow for you,
so hold on for your life.

06:49.510 --> 06:50.510
Right.

06:51.010 --> 06:53.720
It's useless. We can't escape.

06:54.050 --> 06:55.509
So do nothing?

06:55.510 --> 06:59.350
You wanna sit here and hold hands
till we're crushed or burn to death?

06:59.730 --> 07:01.800
Because we're enemies of humanity?

07:03.610 --> 07:07.010
You know, I hate doing this
to you every time, but...

07:07.610 --> 07:08.610
Eren.

07:09.860 --> 07:11.540
You've gotta make the choice.

07:16.410 --> 07:17.910
I'll go with you!

07:25.790 --> 07:26.790
Eren!

07:27.420 --> 07:28.450
I'm sorry...

07:29.470 --> 07:33.510
Since it's the end, just this once...
I want you to let me...

07:34.890 --> 07:37.070
Let me believe in myself!

07:57.200 --> 07:59.159
What... the...?

07:59.160 --> 08:01.410
Everyone! Get underneath Eren!

08:06.420 --> 08:07.420
Caven!

08:26.310 --> 08:27.470
The chapel!

08:35.240 --> 08:36.279
Not good!

08:36.280 --> 08:37.780
Let's try to run!

08:47.420 --> 08:49.360
Section Commander! Are you okay?!

08:49.880 --> 08:51.339
Yeah...

08:51.340 --> 08:52.610
What in the world happened?

09:07.520 --> 09:08.920
What the hell is that?

09:10.730 --> 09:12.530
If it's that big this far away...

09:12.990 --> 09:15.700
It's gotta be twice as big
as the Colossal Titan.

09:16.320 --> 09:17.880
The wall won't stand a chance...

09:18.780 --> 09:19.780
Commander?

09:20.740 --> 09:21.950
Advance!

09:31.920 --> 09:32.920
Eren!

09:35.010 --> 09:36.010
Eren!

09:38.050 --> 09:39.180
Eren!

09:43.220 --> 09:44.220
Eren!

10:05.790 --> 10:07.490
That's what I call hardening.

10:08.540 --> 10:12.990
Even after cutting you away,
the Titan hasn't disappeared.

10:13.920 --> 10:15.550
Pretty impressive, yeah?

10:20.550 --> 10:21.930
That bottle...

10:22.430 --> 10:27.350
Oh, yeah! Right before I turned into
a Titan, I drank that "Armor" bottle...

10:27.600 --> 10:28.600
Yeah.

10:29.190 --> 10:33.170
You couldn't do it at all before now,
but you used the hardening power.

10:33.650 --> 10:34.940
And saved all of us.

10:35.860 --> 10:40.200
In the blink of an eye,
you devised and built all this.

10:40.990 --> 10:46.790
Yeah, the construction looks shoddy, but...
I bet that's how the walls were made, too.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.000
In other words...

10:50.870 --> 10:54.500
It's possible for us to plug
that hole in Wall Maria now.

10:56.090 --> 10:58.669
A lot of enemies and allies
have died on the way,

10:58.670 --> 11:01.510
and getting this far hasn't been pretty,

11:02.260 --> 11:06.270
but for as ugly as it's been,
look at the position we're in now.

11:08.230 --> 11:09.910
Retaking Wall Maria...

11:10.390 --> 11:13.880
Once we do that,
we can investigate my basement.

11:14.690 --> 11:17.280
But, my dad was actually...

11:24.490 --> 11:25.490
Captain!

11:26.700 --> 11:28.450
We've secured an exit!

11:29.160 --> 11:30.370
Armin's safe!

11:30.870 --> 11:32.620
Hange and Moblit, too!

11:33.380 --> 11:34.380
Well done.

11:34.790 --> 11:35.790
Eren!

11:36.170 --> 11:37.170
You okay?

11:38.050 --> 11:40.170
We're all safe, thanks to you!

11:40.590 --> 11:45.969
But to be perfectly honest, when you ran
off prancing while crying like a baby...

11:45.970 --> 11:47.679
...I thought we were doomed!

11:47.680 --> 11:50.853
"It's over, over! Get it
together, nincompoop!

11:50.878 --> 11:53.364
Quit bawling like a
snotty-nosed brat!"

11:53.650 --> 11:55.189
is what I thought.

11:55.190 --> 11:56.190
Hey...

11:57.650 --> 11:58.650
Let's go.

11:58.980 --> 12:01.110
We're going after that big-ass Titan.

12:03.610 --> 12:04.610
Eren!

12:36.020 --> 12:38.799
It's no use! Stay back! We'll get burnt!

12:38.800 --> 12:41.859
Commander, we can't stop it!

12:41.860 --> 12:44.530
It's like an Abnormal and
doesn't care about us!

12:44.820 --> 12:46.260
Enough! Fall back!

12:46.660 --> 12:50.440
All that matters for now is to find
out the direction it's heading.

12:50.870 --> 12:52.980
Commander Erwin! It's Squad Levi!

12:54.210 --> 12:57.050
Eren and Historia are with them!
They succeeded!

13:03.550 --> 13:04.550
Erwin.

13:06.180 --> 13:07.240
Everyone all right?

13:07.800 --> 13:09.890
Hange's our only casualty.

13:11.810 --> 13:13.490
Seems like nothing too serious.

13:14.140 --> 13:16.150
Well done, everyone.

13:16.560 --> 13:19.590
I've got a whole slew of things
to report, but first...

13:19.940 --> 13:20.940
What's that Titan?

13:21.860 --> 13:22.900
It's Rod Reiss.

13:24.780 --> 13:28.360
I think we'll need your
call on this, Commander.

13:33.330 --> 13:36.430
Regardless, we don't have time
to stand here and chat.

13:37.040 --> 13:38.360
Return to Wall Sina.

13:38.960 --> 13:42.380
You're going to let that big ass
crawl right up to the wall?

13:43.130 --> 13:44.920
To Orvud District, actually.

13:45.510 --> 13:47.890
That's most likely where it's headed.

14:16.210 --> 14:17.790
Let's put this all together...

14:18.960 --> 14:25.420
Basically, Rod Reiss was after the Founding
Titan, the Titan power inside Eren.

14:26.420 --> 14:31.480
However, unless it's in someone with Reiss
blood, you won't get its true potential.

14:32.300 --> 14:37.349
Though, even if a Reiss obtains
the Founding Titan's power,

14:37.350 --> 14:40.235
they're controlled by the
First King's will and

14:40.260 --> 14:42.964
refuse to liberate
humanity from the Titans.

14:44.400 --> 14:47.460
Eh? Well, isn't that interesting...

14:48.200 --> 14:51.710
According to the First
King, this is true peace?

14:52.280 --> 14:54.830
Now that's a weird way to look at it.

14:56.160 --> 15:00.080
In other words... we still have an option.

15:01.000 --> 15:05.520
If that Titan eats me,
Rod Reiss will return to a human.

15:06.210 --> 15:10.190
Which means it's still possible
to have a true Founding Titan.

15:11.050 --> 15:12.180
You can't...

15:12.800 --> 15:14.300
Seems that way.

15:15.760 --> 15:18.540
We could capture Rod Reiss
once he becomes a human.

15:18.890 --> 15:20.870
Undo the First King's brainwashing.

15:21.310 --> 15:25.570
If we could do that, it might open
a path to save humanity.

15:27.740 --> 15:28.920
Plus, Eren...

15:29.820 --> 15:32.960
Are you saying you're fully
prepared to let that happen?

15:35.910 --> 15:36.910
I am.

15:40.500 --> 15:42.830
Eren, you can't...

15:44.210 --> 15:46.280
You're forgetting our other option.

15:47.710 --> 15:51.220
First of all, the current
plan is full of flaws.

15:51.880 --> 15:56.380
One, there's no proof that you can
undo Rod Reiss' brainwashing.

15:57.430 --> 16:01.940
No matter how you restrain him, if he
alters humanity's memories, it's over.

16:02.900 --> 16:07.890
Basically, there's too many factors about
the Founding Titan that we just don't know.

16:08.530 --> 16:09.530
True...

16:10.280 --> 16:18.040
Even if Rod Reiss eats Eren, we have
no guarantee that he'll return to normal.

16:18.370 --> 16:19.370
Mmm.

16:20.160 --> 16:23.919
On the other hand, all we've ever
known is destructive pacifists.

16:23.920 --> 16:27.419
But as it stands, the Founding Titan
was taken from them.

16:27.420 --> 16:30.140
This is a once in a lifetime
chance for humanity.

16:31.760 --> 16:32.760
Yes...

16:33.130 --> 16:37.570
Your father was trying to save us
and humanity from the First King.

16:39.520 --> 16:42.229
He stole the Founding
Titan from my sister...

16:42.230 --> 16:44.770
...murdered all of the Reiss children...

16:45.350 --> 16:47.580
...because he had no other choice.

16:50.480 --> 16:54.529
If you want to save Mikasa,
Armin, and everyone else...

16:54.530 --> 16:58.410
...you must learn to control this ability!

17:00.290 --> 17:01.450
Dad...

17:02.160 --> 17:03.180
That's right!

17:03.500 --> 17:08.090
The Dr. Jaeger I know wouldn't do
something like that for no reason at all.

17:08.340 --> 17:13.290
Right. Even without having Reiss blood,
there must be a way to save humanity.

17:13.720 --> 17:16.340
That's why he left you
the key to the basement.

17:21.140 --> 17:22.599
What basement?

17:22.600 --> 17:26.599
Oh, that whole thing?
You mean it's actually important?

17:26.600 --> 17:27.980
Uh, yeah...

17:28.190 --> 17:31.310
We've finally got a way
to plug up the wall.

17:32.360 --> 17:34.740
The way I see it, there's only one choice.

17:35.570 --> 17:37.910
That makes life a little easier.

17:39.490 --> 17:42.270
If it means anything, I
agree with that choice.

17:42.700 --> 17:45.220
Though, are you sure about this, Historia?

17:45.710 --> 17:50.760
We can't exactly have a Titan like that
wandering around inside the walls.

17:51.630 --> 17:53.820
One that big, we can't restrain.

17:54.920 --> 17:55.920
Meaning...

17:58.430 --> 18:01.180
We'll have to kill your father
and there's no way around it.

18:23.950 --> 18:24.950
Eren.

18:25.290 --> 18:26.340
I'm sorry.

18:27.000 --> 18:28.000
Eh?

18:29.120 --> 18:30.700
Underneath the Reiss chapel...

18:31.250 --> 18:35.460
...I really considered becoming
a Titan and killing you.

18:36.840 --> 18:40.120
What's more, not even to save humanity...

18:41.100 --> 18:43.790
Only because I wanted to believe my father.

18:45.270 --> 18:48.370
I didn't want my father to hate me...

18:54.360 --> 18:56.630
But now, it's time to say goodbye.

19:03.580 --> 19:06.540
"Orvud District - Regiment Branch"

19:15.340 --> 19:17.450
Please gather your squad in the hall.

19:18.050 --> 19:20.200
The strategy meeting is about to begin.

19:20.800 --> 19:21.800
All right.

19:23.600 --> 19:26.170
Historia. Forgot to tell you...

19:27.020 --> 19:28.760
We need you to do something.

19:29.270 --> 19:30.270
Yes?

19:32.940 --> 19:34.450
Erwin's orders.

19:35.190 --> 19:39.859
When this battle is over, since you're
the true successor to the throne...

19:39.860 --> 19:40.980
...become the Queen.

19:41.570 --> 19:42.280
Eh?

19:42.530 --> 19:43.410
Huh?

19:43.411 --> 19:46.360
Q-Queen?! Historia?!

19:46.790 --> 19:48.414
The coup d'etat was successful,

19:48.439 --> 19:52.024
but the people won't follow a
regiment sitting at the top.

19:52.460 --> 19:54.839
What we need is a story to spread.

19:54.840 --> 19:58.600
That a true heir retook
the crown from the fake.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.000
I...

20:03.890 --> 20:05.510
Um, Captain?

20:05.850 --> 20:09.269
I'm sure you heard what
Historia said earlier, but...

20:09.270 --> 20:10.590
Well, uh...

20:11.100 --> 20:12.563
By leaving her father,

20:12.588 --> 20:17.284
she finally broke free from that
burden, I guess you could say...

20:17.570 --> 20:19.109
And yet, again...

20:19.110 --> 20:20.110
What?

20:20.440 --> 20:22.449
If you have something to say, say it.

20:22.450 --> 20:23.650
Uh, um...

20:24.070 --> 20:25.310
I-In other words...

20:26.160 --> 20:28.119
Conny's trying to say...

20:28.120 --> 20:33.250
Historia broke free from the Reiss
family and has finally found herself.

20:33.870 --> 20:38.210
And now you're forcing her
into another role? Isn't that...?

20:39.250 --> 20:41.469
Isn't that... not fair to her?

20:41.470 --> 20:42.420
All right.

20:42.420 --> 20:43.420
Eh?

20:44.010 --> 20:46.390
My next duty is to be Queen, right?

20:47.220 --> 20:48.370
Understood.

20:49.470 --> 20:50.720
Historia...

20:51.680 --> 20:53.450
Thanks for your concern.

20:54.100 --> 21:00.730
But whether or not it's forced on me
is up to me to decide, I think.

21:02.280 --> 21:03.280
However...

21:04.070 --> 21:07.120
Captain, I do have one condition.

21:07.700 --> 21:08.700
Hmm?

21:09.450 --> 21:13.330
Since my fate is my own,
I want to lay it all on the line.

21:24.050 --> 21:26.830
When you're Queen,
you can punch that runt in the face.

21:29.850 --> 21:32.519
We've determined the location
of Rod Reiss' Titan.

21:32.520 --> 21:34.320
It's southwest, approaching Orvud.

21:34.730 --> 21:38.140
At this rate, it should reach
Orvud District by dawn.

21:38.520 --> 21:39.570
Understood.

21:39.980 --> 21:43.690
Commander Erwin, we'd all
like to hear what your plan is.

21:44.400 --> 21:47.060
How do you intend to evacuate
the citizens in time?

21:47.660 --> 21:48.910
We won't evacuate.

21:49.580 --> 21:50.580
Wh-What?

21:51.240 --> 21:54.990
We'll have the citizens remain in
Orvud District just as they are.

21:55.210 --> 21:56.709
Uh...

21:56.710 --> 21:58.180
Are you insane?

23:40.640 --> 23:45.330
At Orvud District, Eren and the others
face off against Rod Reiss' Titan.

23:46.070 --> 23:50.860
Meanwhile, Historia is determined
to decide her own fate.

23:51.610 --> 23:54.140
Next episode: "Ruler of the Walls."

23:54.240 --> 23:56.089
"Ruler of the Walls"
